<Base title="About Ville Houttu and ARONIA" description="Meet Ville Houttu, founder of ARONIA. A Finnish engineer and entrepreneur helping established European B2B technology companies build their U.S. business."><div class="wrap about-hero"><div><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div><span class="eyebrow">Ville Houttu / Founder, ARONIA</span><h1>European roots.<br/><span class="serif copper">U.S. operating<br/>experience.</span></h1><p class="lead">I’m a Finnish engineer and entrepreneur. I came to America to build a U.S. business too.</p><p class="muted">ARONIA brings that experience alongside European B2B technology leaders ready to build their next chapter in the U.S.</p></div><figure class="image-frame" style="margin:0"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/photography/ville-outdoor.jpg" alt="Ville Houttu, founder of ARONIA, seated outdoors" width="800" height="1199"/><figcaption class="image-credit">Photo: Levi Vepsa, Kauppalehti</figcaption></figure></div><section class="section sand"><div class="wrap section-intro" style="margin-bottom:0"><span class="eyebrow">Why ARONIA</span><div><h2>A strong business at home.<br/><span class="serif">A new starting point here.</span></h2><p class="lead">In 2016, I moved to California with a mandate to build Vincit’s U.S. business. We had a strong company and track record in Europe. In America, we had to earn it again.</p><p class="muted">I landed our first customer, built the local team and commercial motion, completed three acquisitions, and established a U.S. leadership team. Later, I co-founded Privv and helped build a SaaS business from an idea to $1M ARR.</p><p class="muted">That is the experience behind ARONIA: understanding the European starting point and knowing what it takes to build the American business on the other side.</p><a class="text-link" href="/experience/">Read the operating stories <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">How I work</span><h2>Make the choices.<br/>Get into the market.<br/><span class="serif">Learn quickly.</span></h2></div><div class="deliverables"><article class="deliverable"><span class="small-label">01 / Evidence</span><h3>Start with what is real.</h3><p>Your customers, outcomes, expertise, and market feedback are more useful than broad assumptions.</p></article><article class="deliverable"><span class="small-label">02 / Focus</span><h3>Choose a place to win.</h3><p>A clear initial market, buyer, and offer give your team a direction it can act on.</p></article><article class="deliverable"><span class="small-label">03 / Execution</span><h3>Stay close to the work.</h3><p>Connect priorities to people, actions, and market conversations. Use the evidence to decide what comes next.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="wrap split"><img class="speaking-photo" src="/assets/photography/ville-tedx.jpg" alt="Ville Houttu speaking on the TEDx Youngstown stage" width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy"/><div><span class="eyebrow">Speaking & leadership</span><h2 style="margin-top:25px">Build businesses.<br/><span class="serif">Develop the people<br/>who lead them.</span></h2><p class="muted">My experience building teams has also shaped my work on leadership and employee ownership of decisions, including a TEDx talk and contributions to Forbes and TechCrunch.</p><a class="text-link" href={media[0][2]} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the TEDx talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section" id="recognition-media"><div class="wrap two-columns"><div><span class="eyebrow">Selected recognition</span><h2 style="margin-top:25px">Milestones<br/>along the way.</h2><ul class="recognition-list"><li><strong>Inc. 5000, three consecutive years</strong><span>Vincit USA</span></li><li><strong>Entrepreneur of the Year</strong><span>Greater Irvine Chamber of Commerce</span></li><li><strong>EY Entrepreneur of the Year finalist</strong><span>Ville Houttu</span></li><li><strong>Workplace recognition</strong><span>Vincit USA: Fast Company and Inc.</span></li></ul></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Media & speaking</span><h2 style="margin-top:25px">Ideas shared.</h2><ul class="media-list">{media.map(([name,desc,url])=><li><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span><strong>{name}</strong><br/><span class="muted">{desc}</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>)}</ul></div></div></section><section class="section sand" id="recognition-photos"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Recognition in context</span><div><h2>A few moments<br/><span class="serif">from the journey.</span></h2><p class="muted">Personal milestones and recognition from the businesses I helped build.</p></div></div><div class="recognition-photos"><figure><img src="/assets/photography/ville-vistage-impact-award.jpg" alt="Ville Houttu receiving the Vistage Impact Award" width="1335" height="1600" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>2020 Vistage Impact Award</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/assets/photography/ville-ey-event.jpg" alt="Ville Houttu with a companion at an EY Entrepreneur of the Year event" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>2023 EY Entrepreneur of the Year finalist</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/assets/photography/ville-inno-fire-edited.png" alt="Ville Houttu at the Inno Fire Awards holding a trophy with its recipient name blurred" width="1086" height="1448" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>2025 Innovator Awards winner</strong></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap media-feature"><a href="https://www.kauppalehti.fi/uutiset/a/d28ff2d5-c5b4-49c5-b4d2-7f7f1e697448" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Read the Kauppalehti feature"><img src="/assets/photography/kauppalehti-cover.jpg" alt="Kauppalehti front cover featuring Ville Houttu" width="494" height="727" loading="lazy"/></a><div><span class="eyebrow">In the media</span><h2 style="margin-top:25px">A Finnish perspective.<br/><span class="serif">An international journey.</span></h2><p class="muted">Featured on the cover of Kauppalehti.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.kauppalehti.fi/uutiset/a/d28ff2d5-c5b4-49c5-b4d2-7f7f1e697448" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the feature <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section><CTA/></Base>
